== M7-3 正解(初期の set-overload-bit をその場で置き換え)
show running-config router isis CORE | include overload
 set-overload-bit on-startup wait-for-bgp
show isis protocol | include "verload|startup"
  Most recent startup mode: Cold Restart
  Overload Bit Level-2: configured, clear
      on startup until BGP converges
